  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project aims to support initiatives aimed at enhancing gender equality and empowerment; focused on enhancing women&#x2019;s economic and political participation and leadership by providing skills, supporting overall structural and policy transformation to remove barriers. Similarly CO work on the establishment and implementation of YouthConnekt will be anchored in this project with a specific focus on female youth.</narrative>
